   "id": "aorist",
   "stage": 3,
   "title": "The past tense (aorist)",
   "intro": "The aorist is the normal past for completed actions: Купих хляб (I bought bread). The 2nd and 3rd person singular are identical and have no ending; verbs in -ох change о to е there (четох → чете, отидох → отиде). съм is irregular: бях, беше.",
